  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a vertical broiler to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Thread the lamb slices onto skewers",
    "Broil the lamb for 5 minutes per side",
    "Meanwhile, heat the olive oil in a pan and saute the sliced onion until softened",
    "Add the sliced green pepper to the pan and cook for an additional 2 minutes",
    "Warm the pita bread by wrapping it in foil and heating it in the oven for 5 minutes",
    "Assemble the doner kebab by slicing the cooked lamb and serving it in the pita bread with onion, green pepper, and feta cheese",
    "Drizzle the tomato paste over the top of the kebab and serve immediately"
